  "description": "**PLEASE REPLY BY EMAIL ONLY WITH FULL DETAILS OF ALL APPLICANTS**\n\nSomething special you may say in describing this attractive boutique studio apartment, which has now been released to the rental market.\n\nSituated adjacent to St. Stephen's Green, Portobello and Camden Street, this exceptional location offers an unrivalled selection of cafés, restaurants, bars and local amenities, while Grafton Street is just a short stroll away. The Luas provides easy access to Dundrum Town Centre, with the vibrant villages of Ranelagh and Rathmines also close by, offering an excellent choice of eateries and shops. Trinity College, the Royal College of Surgeons and Dublin's principal business district are all within comfortable walking distance.\n\nThis studio apartment has been tastefully refurbished throughout to provide well-appointed accommodation finished to a high standard. The apartment features a fully fitted kitchen, quality furnishings and a modern shower room. Refuse collection and WiFi are included in the monthly rental payment, adding further convenience for the resident. This apartment offers an excellent opportunity to enjoy comfortable city living in one of Dublin's most desirable locations.",
